# cabin_cloud_cap: the overcast's deck where it sits on the peak (BUILD_PLAN
# S7, 5.8): the deck itself in front of the peak's top, its billowed lit
# tops (snow) and its body (glacier blue) the sky's own, its slate underside
# lowered over the summit to a ragged foot, so the summit is in the cloud
# and the cap is joined to the deck, never a lens of its own. On the far
# layer, at the plate's origin.
